opportunities.evidence:
- **The server already batches.** The control server accepts JSON-RPC arrays and runs them in order (engine/app/src/server.cpp:110-129).
- **None of the agent tools passes a batch through:**
  - the pi `pocket` tool takes one method (integrations/pi/pocket.ts:44-47);
  - MCP `runtime_command` takes one (tools/pocket/src/mcp.rs:86-89, 335-339);
  - `pocket rpc` sends one (mcp.rs:433-469).
- **Agents make many more calls than the reference.** The reference solutions are 1-7 commands: night_lamp 4, glass_window 4, calm_lake 4, raft 4, stormy_dusk 5. Agents made 7-36 calls for the same tasks. In omp-deepseek-full, stormy_dusk took 25 turns, 36 calls, 1.13M tokens and $0.020, the most expensive command task.

